Subject: [PATCH kexec-tools 17/32] arm: return proper error for missing crash
 kernel
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Disposition: inline
Message-Id: <E1axXTL-0004ib-Ho@e0050434b2927.dyn.arm.linux.org.uk>
Date: Tue, 03 May 2016 11:22:31 +0100
